90
00:09:19,968 --> 00:09:22,676
Certo, Dina Anderson. Ótimo.

91
00:09:23,426 --> 00:09:25,300
Tricia Burnett. Certo.

92
00:09:25,301 --> 00:09:26,676
Chloe Bohonos.

93
00:09:27,468 --> 00:09:28,509
Obrigado.

94
00:09:28,510 --> 00:09:31,050
Cherie Collard. Sim.

95
00:09:31,051 --> 00:09:33,260
Avery Graham. Certo.

96
00:09:34,010 --> 00:09:34,926
Para o Hall?

97
00:09:38,718 --> 00:09:39,468
OK.

98
00:09:40,426 --> 00:09:41,551
Maggie McLaren

99
00:09:42,176 --> 00:09:42,968
Bom.

100
00:09:44,385 --> 00:09:45,385
Connie Rhys.

101
00:09:45,968 --> 00:09:46,800
Obrigado.

102
