Enid Sternberg.

103
00:09:48,885 --> 00:09:50,634
Sim. Vivienne Wang.

104
00:09:50,635 --> 00:09:52,009
Obrigado.

105
00:09:52,010 --> 00:09:53,426
Jean Wilson.

106
00:09:59,426 --> 00:10:00,301
Para o Hall?

107
00:10:01,968 --> 00:10:03,010
