140
00:16:09,843 --> 00:16:11,009
Merda.

141
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:11,925
Você estaria fazendo isso conosco

142
00:16:11,926 --> 00:16:13,510
- um grande favor.
 - Uh...

143
00:16:15,176 --> 00:16:17,468
