145
00:16:19,510 --> 00:16:21,384
Obrigada, Kay. Tchau.

146
00:16:27,343 --> 00:16:28,384
Eu sou dentista?

147
00:16:32,051 --> 00:16:33,385
Eu sou um veterinário, porra?

148
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:38,760
Olá, Kay.

149
00:16:42,593 --> 00:16:43,635
O que aconteceu com você?

150
00:16:44,885 --> 00:16:45,884
Então...

151
00:16:45,885 --> 00:16:48,301
A Sra. Kim entra gritando:

152
00:16:49,093 --> 00:16:49,968
