153
00:16:50,926 --> 00:16:53,675
Estou lhe dizendo, tudo estava indo bem.

154
00:16:53,676 --> 00:16:56,426
Osso, ligamentos, nervos.

155
00:16:57,010 --> 00:16:58,634
Ela lutou contra esse poodle maluco

156
00:16:58,635 --> 00:16:59,593
